      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Saint\u2011Eustache\u2019s historic church, built between 1780 and 1783, was rebuilt after the 1837 fire and still bears bullet\u2011hole marks on its front facade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
