      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "From 1965 to 2019, the Autodrome Saint\u2011Eustache hosted stock\u2011car and drag races, drawing motorsport fans to the suburb.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
