      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint-Eustache%2C_Quebec",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1979, General Motors opened a transit\u2011bus plant in Saint\u2011Eustache, producing GM, MCI, and Nova Bus vehicles since 1993.",
